usage: market_runtime.py [-h] --name NAME [--market MARKET] [--port PORT]
                         [--cloudflared CLOUDFLARED] [--require-owner]
                         [--dir DIR] [--kit KIT] [--fixed-config FIXED_CONFIG]

Keep the tunnel and market kit together when the public URL changes.
MARKET_OWNER is inherited from the environment, never written to disk. This
manages processes only; shop choice and trading stay in the agents.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --name NAME
  --market MARKET
  --port PORT
  --cloudflared CLOUDFLARED
                        use this cloudflared executable instead of the SSH
                        tunnel
  --require-owner       wait for MARKET_OWNER or ignored .market/market-owner
                        before starting
  --dir DIR
  --kit KIT             market kit path; otherwise discover the repository or
                        container kit
  --fixed-config FIXED_CONFIG
                        ignored local JSON: reserved public_url and
                        tunnel_command argument list
